cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication kit, please cite the FDS-G1 Complete Series."
title: "FDS-G1 Complete Series: Replication Kit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Wu"
    given-names: "Y."
repository-code: "https://github.com/yiningwu-research/fds-g1-replication-kit"
abstract: "Machine-readable specification, benchmark outputs, reference implementation, and diagnostic layers for the FDS-G1 finite-screen gravity program. v1.2 adds production-refined 8-seed nested-evidence runners, outputs, and validation scripts (production_evidence_v1_2/), the KiDS BandPower EE+nE diagnostic bridge (kids_bandpower_eene_v1_2/), and full-3x2pt sourcing status (phase5_nn_sourcing/). Includes v1.1 KiDS-1000 CLASS-based shear-only stress tests, model cards, prior definitions, likelihood conventions, validation tests, and a D7 finite Markov-screen toy model."
keywords:
  - "cosmology"
  - "dark energy"
  - "modified gravity"
  - "nested sampling"
  - "model comparison"
  - "finite screen gravity"
  - "weak lensing"
  - "KiDS-1000"
license: MIT
version: 1.2
date-released: "2026-06-01"
